## What NOT to conclude

- Sales are not true demand. Lost sales on stocked-out days are not observed.
- Do not extrapolate to new SKUs, large promotions or seasons that are not in the data.
- A total WAPE is not sufficient evidence on its own. Check the per-series and per-fold results.
- Do not change large safety stocks without a pilot.

